<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1020', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', padding: '52px 60px 30px 60px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4D8DFF', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2.2 }}>07 · 结果（2/6）—— H1</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 8 }}>
        H1 被推翻 —— 而干活的是一个判不了的点
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#24334C', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 34, marginTop: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 700, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#93A8C2', letterSpacing: 1.2, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                每次去掉一个任务后的秩相关（A3 臂）
            </Text>
            <svg width='700' height='330' viewBox='0 0 700 330'>
                <line x1='430' y1='8' x2='430' y2='312' stroke='#3A4C68' strokeWidth='1' />
                <line x1='255' y1='8' x2='255' y2='312' stroke='#FFB020' strokeWidth='1' strokeDasharray='4 4' opacity='0.5' />
                <line x1='605' y1='8' x2='605' y2='312' stroke='#FFB020' strokeWidth='1' strokeDasharray='4 4' opacity='0.5' />
                <text x='255' y='326' fill='#FFB020' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' opacity='0.9'>−0.5</text>
                <text x='605' y='326' fill='#FFB020' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' opacity='0.9'>+0.5</text>

                <text x='200' y='30' fill='#C3D0E2' fontSize='14' textAnchor='end'>去掉 pb_t1_tg</text>
                <rect x='430' y='18' width='55' height='17' fill='#3E5A82' />
                <text x='493' y='31' fill='#C3D0E2' fontSize='14'>+0.158</text>

                <text x='200' y='76' fill='#C3D0E2' fontSize='14' textAnchor='end'>去掉 pb_t1_tm</text>
                <rect x='375' y='64' width='55' height='17' fill='#3E5A82' />
                <text x='367' y='77' fill='#C3D0E2' fontSize='14' textAnchor='end'>−0.158</text>

                <text x='200' y='122' fill='#C3D0E2' fontSize='14' textAnchor='end'>去掉 pb_t2_modulus</text>
                <rect x='430' y='110' width='2' height='17' fill='#3E5A82' />
                <text x='422' y='123' fill='#C3D0E2' fontSize='14' textAnchor='end'>0.000</text>

                <text x='200' y='168' fill='#C3D0E2' fontSize='14' textAnchor='end'>去掉 pb_t2_permeability</text>
                <rect x='430' y='156' width='2' height='17' fill='#3E5A82' />
                <text x='422' y='169' fill='#C3D0E2' fontSize='14' textAnchor='end'>0.000</text>

                <text x='200' y='214' fill='#FFFFFF' fontSize='14' fontWeight='bold' textAnchor='end'>去掉 pb_t3_dielectric_loss</text>
                <rect x='430' y='202' width='185' height='18' fill='#FFB020' />
                <text x='620' y='216' fill='#FFB020' fontSize='14' fontWeight='bold'>+0.527</text>

                <text x='200' y='260' fill='#C3D0E2' fontSize='14' textAnchor='end'>去掉 pb_t3_iwlt</text>
                <rect x='245' y='248' width='185' height='18' fill='#3E5A82' />
                <text x='255' y='262' fill='#FFFFFF' fontSize='14' fontWeight='bold'>−0.527</text>
            </svg>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#93A8C2', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 4 }}>
                虚线是 ±0.5 门槛。两次删除都越过 |0.5|，但只有一次越过 +0.5 —— 也就是唯一能救 H1 的那个方向。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 34 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FF6B6B', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>+0.000</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 4 }}>ρ，A3 臂 · 6 个任务</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FF6B6B', lineHeight: 1.05 }}>+0.239</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A8B8CE', marginTop: 4 }}>ρ，A4 臂 · 6 个任务</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                两支臂各自还有<span style={{ color: '#FFB020', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>两处跨层倒序</span>。任一条件单独就能推翻 H1。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C3D0E2', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                四处倒序都含 <span style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>pb_t3_dielectric_loss</span> —— 279 行，bootstrap 区间宽 2.19，A3 的 R² 为 −0.009。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFB020', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                去掉它 ρ 变成 +0.527 / +0.949。我们不去掉：按预注册被推翻，但推翻落在一个判不了的点上 ——
                「没能力检验」，不是「检验了没过」。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 'auto' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>第 32 组 · 链值多少？</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8FA3BC' }}>9 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
